Why this directory differs from the rest of the repository: the runner imports Blender's
Python API (bpy), which is GPL. It is kept as a separate program. The rest of Pavé starts it
as its own process and passes it a job file and a model file, and it writes image files
back; nothing else in Pavé is linked into it.
